## The Founder Proof (always available, use first)
This is the story every rep leads with, because it's the offer's whole logic.
- Kaden built to roughly **\$100k/month** running thousands of accounts across a network, around **100M views/month** on the exact system The Grid installs.
- He got there **after** a ban wiped out roughly **\$70k/month overnight**, everything was on accounts he didn't control. The Grid is what he built so that can never happen again.
- **How to use it:** "The reason this exists is the founder lost everything to one ban and rebuilt it so no single account matters. That's the whole model, your reach lives everywhere, not on one account you could lose tomorrow."
<callout icon="🛡️" color="red_bg">
	Compliance: every number here is Kaden's or a verified client's. Never promise a prospect a dollar figure or a view count. Never say ban-proof / undetectable / guaranteed. "Results vary."
</callout>
